        "file": "paper/Generating_Antichains_Simplified.tex",
        "excerptDigest": "sha256-71f6d228d7ec86f87fde4fb80951ae6aa21ae180ca7da03dda1d4b91d27f3a18"
      },
      "text": "One absolute threshold works for every B above it and every K in the exact stated real-log budget, and |V(B,K)| ≤ 2^(B−√B).",
      "normalizedTextDigest": "sha256-7d9ad0e961e048a6a7254009eaff6a4d1be9e961cb3875835761381fa189d4b1",
      "kind": "correctness",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "file": "paper/Generating_Antichains_Simplified.tex",
          "excerptDigest": "sha256-71f6d228d7ec86f87fde4fb80951ae6aa21ae180ca7da03dda1d4b91d27f3a18"
        }
      ],
      "status": "active"
    },
    {
      "id": "claim-version:3483a2a4-2344-4c43-bc2f-6e13a3a2a671",
      "claimId": "claim:b1655035-c139-40f1-badf-4f7139a0bca4",
      "targetVersionId": "target-version:8b5de558-8fd2-40d6-bfe5-69936f2cc0f4",
      "anchor": {
        "file": "paper/Generating_Antichains_Simplified.tex",
        "excerptDigest": "sha256-e167b838f45bd33fd8f871f2518390e3880b979ac84fd8618941092fe08a74ff"
      },
      "text": "V(B,K) consists exactly of numerical ideal sizes from nonempty families of at most K generators of individual size at most B, with no ambient cap.",
      "normalizedTextDigest": "sha256-42d87277d9c4ab177c1c1b42e2d174d7b129121ede6fa7b9a2e9ca7e1e7d1631",
      "kind": "correctness",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "file": "paper/Generating_Antichains_Simplified.tex",
          "excerptDigest": "sha256-e167b838f45bd33fd8f871f2518390e3880b979ac84fd8618941092fe08a74ff"
        }
      ],
      "status": "active"
    },
    {
      "id": "claim-version:991b703a-ef78-4f6f-aad6-cab1c095890b",
      "claimId": "claim:23ffb6d0-93a7-4c89-922f-32f436f57265",
      "targetVersionId": "target-version:8b5de558-8fd2-40d6-bfe5-69936f2cc0f4",
      "anchor": {
        "file": "paper/Generating_Antichains_Simplified.tex",
        "excerptDigest": "sha256-f03a03e6d69412082e662beed478607e89416249826466b89a3414036ae5abcd"
      },
      "text": "Repeating a final generator and relabelling the active ground set preserve the ideal size and give N ≤ KB.",
      "normalizedTextDigest": "sha256-af99d907532868b62d6197f3ba3148d1d842d86839a3db5fb22d0d46431b0582",
      "kind": "correctness",
      "evidence": [
        {
