        "excerptDigest": "sha256-187ebd399b63dd7a363466cb8bfcb30e1413d0864f14bb369f8070777b870fc0"
      },
      "text": "For each header the attainable-value count is bounded by the product of the incidence, transcript and tail-interval counts.",
      "normalizedTextDigest": "sha256-4bd3a2526b97756655603fdcfe77709ecbeea91e57326bc2e45c8729b359c393",
      "kind": "other",
      "evidence": [
