        "excerptDigest": "sha256-d3f9919cac2127a7895bcf1872133495fe86130101f136dfa38ea420efad99ab"
      },
      "text": "Uniformly in admissible K, Γ≥2^(7λ/10), eventually d≤1/4 and L_rec≤Γ/2, and eventually Γ/4≥√B; summing over headers yields the stronger intermediate bound 2^(B−Γ/4).",
      "normalizedTextDigest": "sha256-04681f552afe5778c919fa259710dcd44f7ce085bfbe58ee8b0b759ab39e9ca2",
